What this app actually is: a menu that gathers this firmware's own,
independently-implemented WiFi/BLE apps (WiFi, Wardriving, BLE Detector,
BLE Spam) under one Marauder-branded entry point, plus two features this
port didn't have that ESP32Marauder is known for:

- PMKID capture (applications/main/wlan_app/wlan_handshake_parser.c:
  wlan_hs_extract_pmkid) -- original C implementing the IEEE 802.11i/WPA2
  PMKID KDE format, a public protocol detail, not copied from Marauder's
  source. No MIT obligation attaches to it; the credit above is a courtesy,
  not a license requirement.
- Probe-request flood (components/wifi/wlan_hal.c:
  wlan_hal_probe_flood_start and friends) -- likewise original, built on
  this repo's own existing wlan_hal raw-TX/beacon-spam pattern.

The one place in this firmware with literally ported ESP32Marauder code is
applications/main/ble_spam/ (see its own NOTICE_MARAUDER and
LICENSE_MARAUDER) -- this app launches that one unmodified via the loader,
it does not duplicate it.
